      "id": "claim_03dc50f1240a401db883ceee17d2c6d5",
      "statement": "A new game cancels the agent-run worker group, starts a _forget worker that waits for the cancelled runs to unwind and then deletes the previous thread's checkpoints with adelete_thread, and creates a new tui-<uuid> thread with reset state; late events and failures from the previous game therefore never reach the new game.",
